上次停下的地方继续。在 C 里，这意味着每个[算子](#算子)都要把自己的进度保存在一个结构体里。选择算子大致是这样的：

```c
typedef struct Operator Operator;

struct Operator {
    void   (*open)(Operator *self);
    Tuple *(*next)(Operator *self);   // returns NULL when exhausted (EOF)
    void   (*close)(Operator *self);
    Operator *child;                  // input operator
    Expr     *pred;                   // predicate, e.g. value > 100
};

// Next() of a selection: keep pulling from the child until a tuple qualifies
Tuple *filter_next(Operator *self) {
    Tuple *t;
    while ((t = self->child->next(self->child)) != NULL) {
        if (eval_pred(self->pred, t))
            return t;
    }
    return NULL;   // child is exhausted, so are we
}
